{title: 500 Hazme tu siervo}
{key: F}
{time: 3/4}
{lyricist: Kelly Willard (1956-; Vers; esp .. Carlos A. Steger (1953-}
{composer: Kelly Willard (1956- )}

[F]Hazme tu siervo, hu[Dm]milde y [Gm]fiel, [C7]
[Gm]que ayude a [C7]todos con tu a[F]mor.
[Dm][F6]Sea el ruego [Bb]de mi cora[Bbm]zón:
[F]hazme tu [Gm]siervo, quie[F]ro escu[Gm]charte
[F]y obede[C7]certe, Se[Bb][F]ñor.
